[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19320.23, "timestamp": "05:22:00", "text": "与那些面孔并无太大不同"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19322.628, "timestamp": "05:22:02", "text": "我这样做是为了那些上学的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19324.678, "timestamp": "05:22:04", "text": "等等，什么？ [笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19325.67, "timestamp": "05:22:05", "text": "[倒吸一口气]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19327.99, "timestamp": "05:22:07", "text": "是的。所以我想到了铃声"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19331.67, "timestamp": "05:22:11", "text": "这。如果我能够在这两方面都取得成功"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19336.628, "timestamp": "05:22:16", "text": "这些，是的，甚至包括我即将推出的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19340.55, "timestamp": "05:22:20", "text": "流媒体嵌入功能也进行了另一次改进。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19342.39, "timestamp": "05:22:22", "text": "这个功能也应该可以运行，但是它却无法运行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19346.47, "timestamp": "05:22:26", "text": "破碎的。我稍后会处理这件事。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19349.83, "timestamp": "05:22:29", "text": "你好。如果我现在能让它运行起来，我就可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19352.39, "timestamp": "05:22:32", "text": "更新所有内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19356.708, "timestamp": "05:22:36", "text": "[叹气和喘息] 是的，我可以更新"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19359.59, "timestamp": "05:22:39", "text": "一切。想象一下，想象一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19362.868, "timestamp": "05:22:42", "text": "我有一个聊天记录系统。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19364.868, "timestamp": "05:22:44", "text": "正确的？就像所有来到这里的人一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19367.83, "timestamp": "05:22:47", "text": "直播流，他们会在这里登录。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19371.35, "timestamp": "05:22:51", "text": "来自 YouTube、Twitch 等平台，所有人都聚集于此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19374.23, "timestamp": "05:22:54", "text": "正确的？但我从不联系。是的，你是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19376.788, "timestamp": "05:22:56", "text": "内特也在这里。但我从未将它与"}]